From: Rune Lillesveen <futhark@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:08:49 -0700
Subject: Turn main-thread QualifiedNameCache DCHECK into CHECK

It may cause UAF and we should crash in production when this happens.

Bug: 577378379
Change-Id: I3d4bc256c6837063de7705a391f37e74ec8bd454
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8666584
Commit-Queue: Rune Lillesveen <futhark@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: David Baron <dbaron@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1731414}

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/qualified_name.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/qualified_name.cc
index a042e87e01eed2ec227016fbd8bb379a7ff70e8a..710bede2704815525dc74fa0a600f1aef42556d1 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/qualified_name.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/qualified_name.cc
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@ using QualifiedNameCache = HashSet<QualifiedNameImpl*>;
 
 static QualifiedNameCache& GetQualifiedNameCache() {
   // This code is lockless and thus assumes it all runs on one thread!
-  DCHECK(IsMainThread());
+  CHECK(IsMainThread());
   static QualifiedNameCache* g_name_cache = new QualifiedNameCache;
   return *g_name_cache;
 }
